00:51:07,058 --> 00:51:13,058
Disney's An Extremely Goofy Movie is a 2000 American animated sports comedy film distributed by Walt Disney
Home Video, produced by Walt Disney Television Animation, and directed by Douglas McCarthy.

12
00:55:45,882 --> 00:55:51,882
It is a sequel to the 1995 film A Goofy Movie and the finale
to the 1992 television series Goof Troop.

13
